1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,420
W: I have an appointment to meet with Mr. Ewing at 2.

2
00:00:03,960 --> 00:00:04,880
Where can I park?

3
00:00:05,360 --> 00:00:09,720
M: I'm sorry, but our underground parking lot is under renovation at the moment.

4
00:00:10,265 --> 00:00:17,720
There is free parking two blocks north of here, but there is a good chance that it might be a full house today because of the art exhibit.

5
00:00:18,715 --> 00:00:23,540
Your best bet is to turn your car around and drive back down this street to the intersection.

6
00:00:24,640 --> 00:00:25,780
There is a pay lot there.

7
00:00:27,025 --> 00:00:29,300
W: That's quite a distance to walk back here.

8
00:00:29,880 --> 00:00:33,655
Do you think I would get a ticket if I just parked somewhere along this street?

9
00:00:34,050 --> 00:00:36,735
M: You can try, but I wouldn't if I were you.

10
00:00:37,320 --> 00:00:39,935
I saw a car being towed away a few days ago.
